# Local data that must never be committed:
#   IGDB credentials, the SQLite library, artwork cache, user themes all live in
#   the OS config dir (%APPDATA%/Selene, ~/.config/Selene), NOT in the repo.
#   These entries only matter if you ever point the config dir at the tree.
credentials.json
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

